{
 "label": "daily-sliding-sum-without-aligned",
 "date": "2026-11-04",
 "set": "sliding-sum-without",
 "description": "A `sum without` over count_over_time or bytes_over_time on a sliding window (range 1m over Grafana's step) is folded by VictoriaLogs before the proxy computes the windows (semantics/without-sliding-sum-folded-buckets): the bucket read groups by the stream text with the excluded pairs cut out, so VictoriaLogs answers a few dozen series instead of one per short-lived pod stream (about 13,500 an hour). SW1 is the A/B shape W8 of unwrap-sum-without, SW2 its byte sum, SW3 a line filter and two excluded labels, SW4 the trailing spelling. SW5 (rate) and SW6 (max without) keep the per-stream route and must not move. The selector leaves out the OTel-instrumented streams and the otel-collector, as W8 does. Run with the control set.",
